{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056650/extras/6c7833f42c164b03d3e9a2b4e57c49e9.poster.avif?t=1762495594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056650/extras/6c7833f42c164b03d3e9a2b4e57c49e9.webm?t=1762495594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056650/extras/6c7833f42c164b03d3e9a2b4e57c49e9.mp4?t=1762495594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056650/extras/a2c5bed8fd4375f275f8417e7d17b2a1.poster.avif?t=1762495594\" width=1128 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056650/extras/a2c5bed8fd4375f275f8417e7d17b2a1.webm?t=1762495594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056650/extras/a2c5bed8fd4375f275f8417e7d17b2a1.mp4?t=1762495594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure to Winter Festival Island with Baby Ogu!<br>Find the missing village chief and uncover the secrets hidden on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056650/extras/26e08e5a470a1842f8a168a993c6ffc4.avif?t=1762495594\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056650/extras/2744654841ead607e5a395e7631abd51.avif?t=1762495594\" width=1091 height=1087 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trouble has broken out on <strong>Winter Festival Island</strong>, where a festival is held every month to celebrate the winter season. <br>What secrets lie hidden on Winter Festival Island, where the village chief has vanished and a yeti has been unleashed?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This DLC adds <strong>45 new maps</strong>, including dungeons, for you to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056650/extras/08f4e8e2bcca95c87237785b93619691.avif?t=1762495594\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056650/extras/850ce968158a2cd908a6bd1e4d783db1.poster.avif?t=1762495594\" width=600 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056650/extras/850ce968158a2cd908a6bd1e4d783db1.webm?t=1762495594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056650/extras/850ce968158a2cd908a6bd1e4d783db1.mp4?t=1762495594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a hot air balloon from <strong>Snowflake Village</strong> and head to <strong>Winter Festival Island</strong>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many residents on Winter Festival Island, where the village chief has disappeared, are in need of Baby Ogu\u2019s help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From familiar headbutt puzzles to mine carts, inverted towers, and the trials of the divine beasts \u2014 a wide variety of content awaits those who enjoyed the main story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056650/extras/1e938c2131549161f19d8e0b89a53e11.avif?t=1762495594\" width=616 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056650/extras/83dd92582482d14a9eaf2ad8cb5d0b13.poster.avif?t=1762495594\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056650/extras/83dd92582482d14a9eaf2ad8cb5d0b13.webm?t=1762495594\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056650/extras/83dd92582482d14a9eaf2ad8cb5d0b13.mp4?t=1762495594\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Become one of the bug villagers and enjoy a tennis match with your friend!<br>Choose your own underwear color and compete in a prideful one-on-one battle.<br>You can play versus mode on a single keyboard or enjoy local multiplayer by connecting one or two gamepads.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056650?t=1762495594","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4056650?t=1762495594","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056650/587dbfb4b821044d7c3f61f0cbd29fabd26d6ea9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762495594","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4056650/587dbfb4b821044d7c3f61f0cbd29fabd26d6ea9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762495594","categories